  [1mThe fork:[0m does [38;5;153mmaxLength[39m cap the [3mfinal[0m string, or the [3msource[0m text before [38;5;153m'...'[39m is appended?

  - [1mEllipsis inside the budget[0m — [38;5;153mformat("abcdefghij", {truncate: 5})[39m → [38;5;153m"ab..."[39m. [38;5;153mformat()[39m gains a real guarantee: output
